{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linha de Fogo FPS is a team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-range environments. Join other players in thrilling PvP battles and coordinate with your team to defeat the opposing team.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customization system allows you to tailor your weapon to suit your needs. Modify sights, grips, barrels, and accessories to achieve optimal performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it out and have fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3088080?t=1761518886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/2bd5d79e919dc6ecffa713611fea2a2a7a2ba532/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761518886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/dde7bc17b92980f5f22f99943a3ffac3922c8d30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761518886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/dde7bc17b92980f5f22f99943a3ffac3922c8d30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761518886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"O jogo cont\u00e9m representa\u00e7\u00f5es de viol\u00eancia moderada/intensa, incluindo combates armados, gritos agonizantes de dor. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 representa\u00e7\u00f5es de atos sexuais, agress\u00e3o sexual ou sexo n\u00e3o consensual. O jogo tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o aborda temas como abuso de drogas, \u00e1lcool ou autoflagela\u00e7\u00e3o. Recomendado para jogadores maiores de de 17, devido \u00e0 natureza do conte\u00fado.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linha de Fogo FPS is a team-based multiplayer gam